  "text_pages": [
    "1.Academic Calendar – JYPE – | Tohoku University\n1.Academic Calendar – JYPE –\nTOP\n>\nFor International Students\n>\nExchange Programs\n>\nJYPE\n>\n1.Academic Calendar – JYPE –\n(updated November 28, 2025)\nFall Semester (Oct. 2026 - Mar. 2027)\n★Mandatory\n★\nProgram Orientation\nSep. 28, 2026\nClass begins\nOct. 1, 2026\nJLPK* Orientation\nTBA （Online Video）\nCourse Registration Period\nOct. 1 - 14, 2026\nJLPK* Course Registration Period\nEarly - Middle Oct., 2026\nWinter Holiday\nDec. 28, 2026 - Jan. 3, 2027\nClass ends\nFeb. 3, 2027\n★\nPresentation\nFeb 4-5,  2027\nSupplementary Class Period (if any)\nEarly - Middle Feb., 2027\nSelf-Education Period**\nFeb. 6 - March 31., 2027\n*Japanese Language Program at Kawauchi\n**Only applicable to those attending the one-year program.\nClass Schedule of AY2026 General Education Subjects\nAcademic Calendar of AY2026 General Education Subjects\nSpring Semester (Apr. 2026- Sep. 2026)\n★Mandatory\n★\nProgram Orientation\nApr. 2, 2026\nClass begins\nApr. 8, 2026\nJLPK* Orientation\nTBA（Online Video）\nCourse Registration Period\nApr. 8 -21, 2026\nJLPK* Course Registration Period\nTBA\nClass ends\nAug. 5, 2026\n★\nPresentation\nAug. 5-7, 2026 (After the final class)\n*Japanese Language Program at Kawauchi (Guide)\nClass Schedule of AY2026 General Education Subjects\nAcademic Calendar of AY2026 General Education Subjects"
  ],
